:BISLPS-25230SC2*

[INFO:Requires Apollo with Python support (PS3/PS4 apps with PS2 cards or the web patcher), not Apollo PS2]
[INFO:The save has two copies (SC2 and SC2_1): apply the same cheats to both files]
[INFO:Also select the Decrypt, checksum and Encrypt codes, they are not applied automatically]

[python:Decrypt SC2 (Required)]
import soulcalibur2 as sc2
sc2.decrypt(savedata)

[python:Max Gold 99,999,900]
import soulcalibur2 as sc2
sc2.max_gold(savedata, "SLPS25230")

[python:Max Experience (Ultimate Edgemaster)]
import soulcalibur2 as sc2
sc2.max_experience(savedata, "SLPS25230")

[python:Unlock All Characters, Modes, Stages and Weapons]
import soulcalibur2 as sc2
sc2.unlock_all(savedata, "SLPS25230")

[python:All Weapon Master Chapters Cleared]
import soulcalibur2 as sc2
sc2.all_chapters(savedata, "SLPS25230")

[python:Update SC2 Key Checksum (Required)]
import soulcalibur2 as sc2
sc2.fix(savedata)

[python:Encrypt SC2 (Required)]
import soulcalibur2 as sc2
sc2.encrypt(savedata)
